{"title":"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In 1960 only 5% of the working adults in Carlin City worked\nat home. By 1970 the \"at-home\" work force had increased to\n8%. In 1980 there were approximately 15% working at home,\nand in 1990 there were 30%. The graph that best illustrates\nthis is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/6/656eabcc57c768cb1f63e28160766b9874093f65.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(18);  draw((0,4)--(0,0)--(7,0)); draw((0,1)--(.2,1)); draw((0,2)--(.2,2)); draw((0,3)--(.2,3)); draw((2,0)--(2,.2)); draw((4,0)--(4,.2)); draw((6,0)--(6,.2)); for (int a = 1; a &lt; 4; ++a) { for (int b = 1; b &lt; 4; ++b) { draw((2*a,b-.1)--(2*a,b+.1)); draw((2*a-.1,b)--(2*a+.1,b)); } } label(&quot;1960&quot;,(0,0),S); label(&quot;1970&quot;,(2,0),S); label(&quot;1980&quot;,(4,0),S); label(&quot;1990&quot;,(6,0),S); label(&quot;10&quot;,(0,1),W); label(&quot;20&quot;,(0,2),W); label(&quot;30&quot;,(0,3),W); label(&quot;$\\%$&quot;,(0,4),N);  draw((12,4)--(12,0)--(19,0)); draw((12,1)--(12.2,1)); draw((12,2)--(12.2,2)); draw((12,3)--(12.2,3)); draw((14,0)--(14,.2)); draw((16,0)--(16,.2)); draw((18,0)--(18,.2)); for (int a = 1; a &lt; 4; ++a) { for (int b = 1; b &lt; 4; ++b) { draw((2*a+12,b-.1)--(2*a+12,b+.1)); draw((2*a+11.9,b)--(2*a+12.1,b)); } } label(&quot;1960&quot;,(12,0),S); label(&quot;1970&quot;,(14,0),S); label(&quot;1980&quot;,(16,0),S); label(&quot;1990&quot;,(18,0),S); label(&quot;10&quot;,(12,1),W); label(&quot;20&quot;,(12,2),W); label(&quot;30&quot;,(12,3),W); label(&quot;$\\%$&quot;,(12,4),N);  draw((0,12)--(0,8)--(7,8)); draw((0,9)--(.2,9)); draw((0,10)--(.2,10)); draw((0,11)--(.2,11)); draw((2,8)--(2,8.2)); draw((4,8)--(4,8.2)); draw((6,8)--(6,8.2)); for (int a = 1; a &lt; 4; ++a) { for (int b = 1; b &lt; 4; ++b) { draw((2*a,b+7.9)--(2*a,b+8.1)); draw((2*a-.1,b+8)--(2*a+.1,b+8)); } } label(&quot;1960&quot;,(0,8),S); label(&quot;1970&quot;,(2,8),S); label(&quot;1980&quot;,(4,8),S); label(&quot;1990&quot;,(6,8),S); label(&quot;10&quot;,(0,9),W); label(&quot;20&quot;,(0,10),W); label(&quot;30&quot;,(0,11),W); label(&quot;$\\%$&quot;,(0,12),N);  draw((12,12)--(12,8)--(19,8)); draw((12,9)--(12.2,9)); draw((12,10)--(12.2,10)); draw((12,11)--(12.2,11)); draw((14,8)--(14,8.2)); draw((16,8)--(16,8.2)); draw((18,8)--(18,8.2)); for (int a = 1; a &lt; 4; ++a) { for (int b = 1; b &lt; 4; ++b) { draw((2*a+12,b+7.9)--(2*a+12,b+8.1)); draw((2*a+11.9,b+8)--(2*a+12.1,b+8)); } } label(&quot;1960&quot;,(12,8),S); label(&quot;1970&quot;,(14,8),S); label(&quot;1980&quot;,(16,8),S); label(&quot;1990&quot;,(18,8),S); label(&quot;10&quot;,(12,9),W); label(&quot;20&quot;,(12,10),W); label(&quot;30&quot;,(12,11),W); label(&quot;$\\%$&quot;,(12,12),N);  draw((24,12)--(24,8)--(31,8)); draw((24,9)--(24.2,9)); draw((24,10)--(24.2,10)); draw((24,11)--(24.2,11)); draw((26,8)--(26,8.2)); draw((28,8)--(28,8.2)); draw((30,8)--(30,8.2)); for (int a = 1; a &lt; 4; ++a) { for (int b = 1; b &lt; 4; ++b) { draw((2*a+24,b+7.9)--(2*a+24,b+8.1)); draw((2*a+23.9,b+8)--(2*a+24.1,b+8)); } } label(&quot;1960&quot;,(24,8),S); label(&quot;1970&quot;,(26,8),S); label(&quot;1980&quot;,(28,8),S); label(&quot;1990&quot;,(30,8),S); label(&quot;10&quot;,(24,9),W); label(&quot;20&quot;,(24,10),W); label(&quot;30&quot;,(24,11),W); label(&quot;$\\%$&quot;,(24,12),N);  draw((0,9)--(2,9.25)--(4,10)--(6,11)); draw((12,8.5)--(14,9)--(16,10)--(18,10.5)); draw((24,8.5)--(26,8.8)--(28,10.5)--(30,11)); draw((0,0.5)--(2,1)--(4,2.8)--(6,3)); draw((12,0.5)--(14,.8)--(16,1.5)--(18,3));  label(&quot;(A)&quot;,(-1,12),W); label(&quot;(B)&quot;,(11,12),W); label(&quot;(C)&quot;,(23,12),W); label(&quot;(D)&quot;,(-1,4),W); label(&quot;(E)&quot;,(11,4),W); [/asy]\" width=\"1002\" height=\"408\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The data are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c961c99bd562f7272e46ac90b903366a1966afc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1960 (5\\%)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/1252a3da4d0b8a630e1aaf8fe9af1adff7b6a284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1970 (8\\%)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/3/bb34bdef35e42d8295211b009090e6802d76dc41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1980 (15\\%)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/d/81dc770feee4175080794ce6831b3fa55cd2a1a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1990 (30\\%)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" />. Only one of these graphs has the answer and that is choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can look at the graphs and note that the only one that has all the correct points is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8\" title=\"2000 AMC 8\">2000 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2000\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/P